{
 "slug": "burnt-ai-alternative",
 "pageId": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
 "text_batches": [
  [
   {
    "label": "t0",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "c3df870f-ba8c-9aaf-796c-bb1249eeefa3"
     },
     "text": "20-30 Min"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t1",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5fe9d"
     },
     "text": "Handed back on each order that was a call"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t2",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "3027ca32-6180-79a6-1a66-d9f911e27a08"
     },
     "text": "24-48 Hrs"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t3",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5fea2"
     },
     "text": "Is the window most distributors go live in"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t4",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "448bf1fe-361f-3c13-6268-4572092953ba"
     },
     "text": "Same Day"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t5",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5feac"
     },
     "text": "Is the day most kitchens begin sending orders"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t6",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "1cd5e3b3-4adf-89d2-b8a1-ba35fe69754d"
     },
     "text": "Why Teams Compare"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t7",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8be"
     },
     "text": "Why teams want an alternative to Burnt AI"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t8",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8c2"
     },
     "text": "Burnt calls itself an AI watchtower for food distribution and deploys agents by team: one for order intake, one for purchasing, one that calls customers about money they owe. It is a serious piece of engineering, and a Burnt AI alternative search rarely means it has failed. The question behind it is narrower: who should confirm what a kitchen asked for?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t9",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "eb7fd825-30c6-7275-9a2f-c98f68eb960f"
     },
     "text": "Software decides when a person looks"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t10",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8cc"
     },
     "text": "Burnt's own page says confidence thresholds decide when human review is required. That is a sensible design, and it still means the exceptions land on your desk. Nowhere does it say the customer sees the order first."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t11",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "bacfcf90-d337-55e1-9a02-49b2f6962e16"
     },
     "text": "A voicemail still starts as a voicemail"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t12",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8d3"
     },
     "text": "Burnt transcribes what comes in by phone or as a voicemail, which is genuinely useful. But the order begins as a loose message, and the cook who left it never sees the lines your system ends up holding."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t13",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "83921d0d-4ec1-911e-4420-fee5bfd13614"
     },
     "text": "Agents that work are worth keeping"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t14",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8da"
     },
     "text": "If intake, purchasing and collections are already earning their keep, pulling the platform out to change who confirms an order would be a lot of disruption for one habit."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t15",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "f5b08e4d-7503-2dae-cdd2-6f455d9fe83d"
     },
     "text": "A Burnt AI alternative that keeps every agent"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t16",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "f49b7c29-2a8e-b047-d714-742b52e0a34c"
     },
     "text": "What You Get"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t17",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "d4031fde-2fc3-b283-bb1c-784e741d725b"
     },
     "text": "Voice Ordering"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t18",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "24599529-959c-8515-3ff2-44ca6d68a0ed"
     },
     "text": "Said out loud, checked on screen, then sent"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t19",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "24599529-959c-8515-3ff2-44ca6d68a0f1"
     },
     "text": "Your buyer holds the button down and the items appear as a list with quantities. They fix or confirm each line before it goes, so nobody at your end pieces the order together afterwards. The order you receive is the order they signed off."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t20",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4133"
     },
     "text": "No threshold decides whether a person should look"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t21",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4139"
     },
     "text": "Spoken in the cooler or the office, at any hour"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t22",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe413f"
     },
     "text": "20 to 30 minutes back against the same order by phone"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t23",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4145"
     },
     "text": "Interrupted halfway? It holds the order until they come back"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t24",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "d5d6538b-4114-51aa-7fff-aad875b7bfe3"
     },
     "text": "Order Guides"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t25",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdea2"
     },
     "text": "Your item list is the whole configuration"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t26",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdea6"
     },
     "text": "There is no model to train and no workflow to draw. You hand over the item lists you keep per customer, we load them against your SKUs at your prices, and setup is done."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t27",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdead"
     },
     "text": "A kitchen sees nothing but the lines it buys"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t28",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdeb3"
     },
     "text": "Pricing and the catalog remain yours to set"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t29",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdeb9"
     },
     "text": "Change a list once and it stands on the orders after"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t30",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdebf"
     },
     "text": "Nothing to tune as volumes grow"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t31",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "6555f9fc-4dcc-b940-f384-6001ce4db69f"
     },
     "text": "Delivery Formats"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t32",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb118"
     },
     "text": "It reaches you in a format you already read"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t33",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb11c"
     },
     "text": "A finished order leaves as an email carrying a PDF, Excel or Word file, or goes straight into your ERP over the API, over EDI, or into QuickBooks. Your desk does not move anywhere new."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t34",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb123"
     },
     "text": "Addressed to a rep, or to the purchasing desk"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t35",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb129"
     },
     "text": "On a direct feed there is no rekeying at your end"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t36",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb12f"
     },
     "text": "Picking, billing and delivery carry on unchanged"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t37",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb135"
     },
     "text": "No part of your stack has to be retired first"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t38",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "099f67ce-06ef-dc92-c6e6-fdc4481f359f"
     },
     "text": "Inventory Visibility"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t39",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df93a"
     },
     "text": "Stock visible as the orders arrive"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t40",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df93e"
     },
     "text": "VoiceOrder Solutions carries real-time inventory visibility tied to what is being ordered, and the catalog updates as stock levels change. It is not the system of record for stock: yours stays in charge, and a demo shows how the levels connect."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t41",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df945"
     },
     "text": "Every line you carry, not only the quick movers"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t42",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df94b"
     },
     "text": "Fewer stockout surprises on a late, heavy order"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t43",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df951"
     },
     "text": "Numbers come out of whatever you count with now"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t44",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df957"
     },
     "text": "We never count or buy stock for you"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t45",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "021e8cc1-41f6-a5cc-3995-2a8c101d005c"
     },
     "text": "Side By Side"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t46",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da64e7"
     },
     "text": "Burnt's agents and VoiceOrder Solutions, each on its own job"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t47",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da64ec"
     },
     "text": "We are not a Burnt AI replacement and have no ambition to be one. Our app takes a single job, the order a buyer confirms, and leaves the agents to everything else."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t48",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da6507"
     },
     "text": "Give the agent less to guess at"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t49",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da650a"
     },
     "text": "Every account you move onto our app sends structured, approved orders instead of a voicemail to transcribe. Burnt keeps handling everything else that arrives."
    }
   }
  ],
  [
   {
    "label": "t50",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "5368ca22-de87-9362-819f-9733489b5a6d"
     },
     "text": "Leave purchasing and chasing alone"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t51",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "5368ca22-de87-9362-819f-9733489b5a70"
     },
     "text": "We have no view on your purchasing and never touch an invoice. If those agents are earning their money, nothing here asks you to undo them."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t52",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "ce9a8dd2-5aea-6c74-fe2d-a05cf2535624"
     },
     "text": "One destination, however many tools"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t53",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "ce9a8dd2-5aea-6c74-fe2d-a05cf2535627"
     },
     "text": "On EDI, the API or QuickBooks, ours land in the same system you chose, so your desk has no second place to check."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t54",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "4590e4b1-e797-fe36-9056-58de9ded19b4"
     },
     "text": "See an approved order land beside your agents"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t55",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "4590e4b1-e797-fe36-9056-58de9ded19b8"
     },
     "text": "Twenty minutes. One order spoken by a buyer, approved by that buyer, landing in the format your desk already opens."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t56",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "6923bf1d-5310-eba9-bcb8-7266c5f85e97"
     },
     "text": "Getting Started"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t57",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ec7"
     },
     "text": "Three steps, and nobody visits"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t58",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "38293a1d-fb4c-9501-8014-28855f9128b6"
     },
     "text": "There is no discovery phase and no IT project, and no agent to brief."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t59",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ed6"
     },
     "text": "Send over the lists"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t60",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5eda"
     },
     "text": "Whatever format they are already in. Each account's lines and your prices go into a single admin screen, lined up with your codes."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t61",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ede"
     },
     "text": "Each buyer gets a login"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t62",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ee3"
     },
     "text": "We set up each account, and the kitchen downloads the app. Most send something in before the day is out."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t63",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5f00"
     },
     "text": "It arrives complete"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t64",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5f04"
     },
     "text": "Signed off by the buyer, carrying a number and a time, in the shape your system expects."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t65",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a176"
     },
     "text": "Burnt with VoiceOrder Solutions beside it."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t66",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "0c6cf9c7-bbe3-a64d-76b9-1539a90ac7c8"
     },
     "text": "Every agent stays."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t67",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "7b8acd63-aca8-b070-4eb6-f64ce47abebc"
     },
     "text": "One More Step"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t68",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a179"
     },
     "text": "Nothing in this table goes backwards when you add us. People weighing a Burnt AI alternative usually want to know one thing, who signs off an order before it counts, so the rows set Burnt today against Burnt with our app added. The two products are not linked, and every Burnt detail is taken from their own site."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t69",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "1ff87819-9b94-6168-dfbb-e81fd6a5b236"
     },
     "text": "Feature"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t70",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a18d"
     },
     "text": "Burnt + VoiceOrder Solutions"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t71",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a19e"
     },
     "text": "Burnt on its own"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t72",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1be"
     },
     "text": "Your buyer signs the order off before it sends"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t73",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "89a5813a-10f6-6ba1-6eed-d733971a550a"
     },
     "text": "Reviewed by exception"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t74",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1c8"
     },
     "text": "Orders lifted out of email, WhatsApp and EDI"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t75",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1d5"
     },
     "text": "Accounts speak the order into an app"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t76",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1e2"
     },
     "text": "Each account has its own list, at your prices"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t77",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1ec"
     },
     "text": "Order number and the time it was sent"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t78",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1f6"
     },
     "text": "Agents for purchasing and supplier messages"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t79",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a210"
     },
     "text": "Overdue invoices chased by phone"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t80",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a21a"
     },
     "text": "Custom agents built for your own operation"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t81",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a224"
     },
     "text": "Orders flow into the ERP you run"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t82",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "30f8c397-6bf9-f190-2eb1-183dc2b44d9e"
     },
     "text": "FAQ"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t83",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf956"
     },
     "text": "Burnt AI competitor, or one more step beside it?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t84",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "8bf0eb84-6a8d-dd56-6a0e-8116d9416d3d"
     },
     "text": "Should I look for a Burnt AI alternative so buyers can order by speaking?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t85",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf967"
     },
     "text": "There is no need. Your Burnt agents can stay exactly as they are. VoiceOrder Solutions sits beside them as one more way in for orders: the buyer speaks it, checks it and sends it. Nothing has to be turned off."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t86",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "ad9f0390-a776-7031-a95b-984cd1988c9e"
     },
     "text": "Is VoiceOrder Solutions better than Burnt AI?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t87",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf973"
     },
     "text": "On breadth, no, and it would be silly to pretend otherwise. Burnt reads channels we never touch and automates procurement and invoice chasing, which we never go near. Where we are strong is specific: the buyer approves the order, so whoever knows the kitchen settles whether it is right. If that point is why you started looking for a Burnt AI alternative, you can add it rather than swap."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t88",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "e219e293-819b-221b-6d80-7f8d2898a4d7"
     },
     "text": "Do the two products link up?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t89",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf97f"
     },
     "text": "No. There is no connection between Burnt and our app, and no joint support. Their agents keep passing what they process into your system. Ours arrive separately, either emailed with a file or fed straight into your system."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t90",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "39590628-381c-9aea-6095-0746f7348939"
     },
     "text": "Can our accounts still email or WhatsApp their orders?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t91",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf98b"
     },
     "text": "Yes, and Burnt carries on reading them: it lists email, phone, voicemail, WhatsApp, SMS, EDI, portals and spreadsheets. We do not parse any inbound channel at all. A call that reaches your own desk carries no number from us, and no time stamp either: those come only with what is sent from our app."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t92",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "0f73d180-08e9-596f-f264-a95de40f9593"
     },
     "text": "How soon could our accounts be ordering?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t93",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "7e541655-5a68-8f96-1273-8249a5c759bd"
     },
     "text": "Most distributors are up and running within 24 to 48 hours, and most kitchens place their first order on day one. Burnt keeps running throughout, so there is no switchover to schedule."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t94",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "d9956fbb-a3d6-4b04-b3ab-98b6f5ae509f"
     },
     "text": "Will anyone need to come to our site?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t95",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "4446ea80-4c7a-f2a8-f0de-0a222818c94f"
     },
     "text": "Not for this. We set up from the guides you send over, with no implementation project. Burnt describes white-glove onboarding with their team working on your premises; if that already happened for your agents, adding us does not repeat it."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t96",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "93ba65b0-4eb0-c64e-d0c0-933cd7a92b1d"
     },
     "text": "What does VoiceOrder Solutions cost if we keep Burnt?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t97",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf997"
     },
     "text": "Neither of us publishes a rate card. We quote per distributor once we know what you run, and Burnt quotes after a demo. Since the agents stay, the only figure to weigh is the price of adding our app."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t98",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "7ec95cf1-65b0-b7be-b209-990427524516"
     },
     "text": "Where do the Burnt details on this page come from?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t99",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a58ca02f812a31bf517",
      "element": "7ec95cf1-65b0-b7be-b209-99042752451e"
     },
     "text": "Burnt's own website, read on 10 October 2026: the agent list and the on-site onboarding line off their homepage, and the channel list and the confidence-threshold wording off their sales and operations product page. We have left their accuracy and time-saving figures out, because those are their numbers to stand behind. If any of it has changed, this page is what needs correcting."
    }
   }
  ]
 ],
